			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2463724">
									

<p>Certainly an interesting concept but the execution leaves a little to be desired. The nature of SCP-2603 being a person and also a war zone reminds me strongly of <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-1761">The Republic of Arnold Fitzwilliams</a>, and the description of the dream sequence was terrific.</p>
<p>However, there's no real explanation why the Foundation assumes that the entities are trying to seize control of Tullo's subconsciousness, nor is there an explanation for how they know this can be done by reaching the bridge.</p>

