			<div class="content" id="post-content-2463727">
									

<p>I can see the potential parallels with <a href="/scp-1761">SCP-1761</a>, but they really aren't much alike. Basically, what this article (and the rest of the Oneiroi articles/tales) are positing is that everyone is prima real estate. This particular real estate is just in high demand apparently.</p>
<p>As for the exposition needed to tell you, the reader, things that in-universe the Foundation knows from previous dealings with the Oneiroi and from MTF-Omicron-Rho's records, I felt that was something that would weigh down the actual article. I assumed readers would associate the bridge with control, and would get the implication that entities attempting to reach that bridge were vying for control of 2603's subconscious. You're right, it's never spelled out why this is, but I didn't feel it was strictly necessary to make the scip interesting. :)</p>

							</div>

								
